      "published": "Mon, 14 Sep 2026 15:02:21 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>Laura Barrón-López to headline AccessFest 2026 Investigative Reporters &#38; Editors is honored to announce that Laura Barrón-López will headline our keynote conversation for AccessFest26, the organization’s sixth virtual-by-design conference Oct. 8-10. Barrón-López serves as an MS NOW White House Reporter. Her most recent reporting for MS NOW includes President Trump’s campaign to take over elections,&#8230;</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.ire.org/2026/09/14/laura-barron-lopez-to-headline-accessfest-2026/\">Laura Barrón-López to headline AccessFest 2026</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.ire.org\">Investigative Reporters and Editors</a>.</p>",
